# Enterprise Innovation Idea Management System — Implementation Plan

## Overview

Build a full-stack web application for managing enterprise innovation ideas. The system runs on Node.js/Express with SQLite for persistence, and serves a modern responsive web UI with vanilla HTML/CSS/JS.

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Choice |
|---|---|
| Runtime | Node.js |
| Framework | Express.js |
| Database | SQLite (via `better-sqlite3`) |
| File upload | `multer` |
| Auth | Session-based (express-session + bcryptjs) |
| Frontend | Vanilla HTML5 / CSS3 / JS (no build step) |

---

## User Roles & Workflow

```
Employee → Submit Idea
                ↓
        [STATUS: pending_review]
                ↓
         Reviewer Reviews
      ┌── reject → [rejected]
      └── approve → [approved]
                ↓
      Employee Uploads Evidence
                ↓
        [STATUS: evidence_submitted]
                ↓
      Expert Team Evaluates (1+ experts)
      ┌── reject → [evaluation_rejected]
      └── approve → [evaluated]
                ↓
         Needs Project? (yes/no flag)
      └── yes → [project_pending]
                ↓
         Admin Creates Project Record
                ↓
           [project_established]
```

---

## Database Schema

### Tables
- **users** — id, name, email, password_hash, role (employee/reviewer/expert/admin), department_id
- **departments** — id, name, description
- **ideas** — id, title, description, category, department_id, submitter_id, status, needs_project, created_at, updated_at
- **reviews** — id, idea_id, reviewer_id, decision (approve/reject), comment, created_at
- **evidences** — id, idea_id, description, file_path, file_name, created_at
- **evaluations** — id, idea_id, expert_id, score (1-10), comment, recommend_project (bool), created_at
- **projects** — id, idea_id, project_name, project_code, manager, budget, start_date, status, created_at
- **idea_categories** — predefined: 技术创新, 流程优化, 产品创新, 管理创新, 市场开拓, 其他

