## Key Features Per Page

### Dashboard (dashboard.html)
- Kanban board: columns for each status (pending/approved/evidence/evaluated/project)
- Pie charts: ideas by category, by department
- Bar chart: monthly idea submissions trend
- Summary KPI cards: total ideas, approval rate, avg evaluation score

### Idea List (ideas.html)
- Filterable table: by status, category, department, date range
- Role-based action buttons (review / upload evidence / evaluate / establish project)

### Idea Detail (idea-detail.html)
- Full timeline showing each workflow stage with timestamps and actor info
- Inline review form (reviewer only)
- Evidence upload section (submitter, after approval)
- Expert evaluation form (expert only, shows all submitted evaluations)
- Project establishment form (admin only, if flagged)

### Admin Panel (admin.html)
- User management: create/edit users, assign roles and departments
- Department management: CRUD
- System overview stats

---

## Seed Data

Auto-seeded on first run:
- 5 departments
- 6 predefined categories  
- Demo accounts for each role (employee/reviewer/expert/admin)

